locked.description:
Gets or sets whether the billing line is locked after the operation.

`true` if the operation succeeded or the billing line was already locked;
`false` if the billing line was in an illegal state for locking.

unlocked.description:
Gets or sets whether the billing line is unlocked after the operation.

`true` if the billing line was unlocked or was already in a non-locked state;
`false` if the required resource lock or state check failed.
